# See http://help.github.com/ignore-files/ for more about ignoring files.
#
# If you find yourself ignoring temporary files generated by your text editor
# or operating system, you probably want to add a global ignore instead:
#   git config --global core.excludesfile '~/.gitignore_global'

# PDF files in this project are a common artefact, and are thus
# ignored by default. PDFs that should be part of the repo can, and
# should, be explicitly added with 'git add'.
*.pdf

# pyenv local version
.python-version

# Mac OS system files
.DS_Store
._*
.AppleDouble

# Windows system files
Thumbs.db

## Emacs
*~
\#*\#
.\#*

## Other python stuff
.idea/
typings/
mpy-libs/

